text:
下面是您需要的横版动作战斗系统试玩作品，一个完整的单文件 HTML，可直接在桌面浏览器中运行，专注于爽快的连击、命中顿帧与肢体破坏。
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>影刃 - 横版动作试玩</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        html,
        body {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #0a0a12;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        #game-container {
            position: relative;
            width: min(100vw, calc(100vh * 16 / 9));
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            background: #0d0d18;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: #0d0d18;
            cursor: default;
        }
        #ui-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 14px;
        }
        .ui-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .ui-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .ui-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        #hp-bar-wrap {
            width: 200px;
            height: 14px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 7px;
            overflow: hidden;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        #hp-bar {
            height: 100%;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e74c3c, #f39c12, #2ecc71);
            transition: width 0.12s ease-out;
            border-radius: 7px;
        }
        .ui-label {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        #kill-count {
            color: #ffd700;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .btn-mute {
            pointer-events: auto;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: rgba(20, 20, 35, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-mute:hover {
            background: rgba(50, 50, 80, 0.9);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }
        .btn-mute:active {
            transform: scale(0.94);
        }
        #start-screen {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            pointer-events: auto;
            background: rgba(8, 8, 16, 0.85);
            z-index: 10;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }
        #start-screen h1 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(150, 200, 255, 0.6), 0 0 60px rgba(100, 150, 255, 0.3);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        #start-screen .subtitle {
            color: #aac;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        #start-screen .controls-hint {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 2;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .key-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 1px 7px;
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #fff;
            margin: 0 2px;
        }
        #btn-start {
            pointer-events: auto;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e6b, #1a1a3e);
            border: 1px solid rgba(180, 200, 255, 0.5);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 36px;
            font-size: 18px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            transition: all 0.25s;
            box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(80, 120, 255, 0.3);
        }
        #btn-start:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3a4e8b, #2a2a5e);
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(100, 150, 255, 0.55);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        #btn-start:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }
        #death-screen {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            pointer-events: auto;
            background: rgba(10, 0, 0, 0.7);
            z-index: 9;
        }
        #death-screen .death-text {
            color: #ff4444;
            font-size: 32px;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 60, 60, 0.7);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        #death-screen .restart-hint {
            color: #ddd;
            font-size: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            animation: pulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,
            100% {
                opacity: 0.5;
            }
            50% {
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }
        .cooldown-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 60px;
            right: 20px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .cd-box {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .cd-fill {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 0%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            transition: height 0.08s linear;
        }
        .cd-box span {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="game-container">
        <canvas id="game-canvas"></canvas>
        <div id="ui-overlay">
            <div class="ui-row">
                <div class="ui-left">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">
                        <span class="ui-label">HP</span>
                        <div id="hp-bar-wrap"><div id="hp-bar"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <span id="kill-count" class="ui-label">斩敌: 0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ui-right">
                    <button class="btn-mute" id="btn-mute" aria-label="静音切换">🔊 音效</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ui-row" style="justify-content:flex-end;padding-bottom:4px;">
                <div class="cooldown-indicator" id="cd-indicators">
                    <div class="cd-box" id="cd-dash"><div class="cd-fill"></div><span>L</span></div>
                    <div class="cd-box" id="cd-special"><div class="cd-fill"></div><span>I</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="start-screen">
            <h1>影 刃</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">SHADOW BLADE</div>
            <div class="controls-hint">
                <span class="key-badge">A/D</span> 或 <span class="key-badge">←/→</span> 移动 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <span class="key-badge">Space</span> 跳跃 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <span class="key-badge">J</span> 轻斩连段<br>
                <span class="key-badge">K</span> 重斩·断肢 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <span class="key-badge">L</span> 冲刺闪避 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <span class="key-badge">I</span> 剑气 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <span class="key-badge">R</span> 重开
            </div>
            <button id="btn-start">Enter 开始</button>
        </div>
        <div id="death-screen">
            <div class="death-text">YOU DIED</div>
            <div class="restart-hint">按 R 重新战斗</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script>
        (function() {
            // ==================== 常量与配置 ====================
            const W = 1600;
            const H = 900;
            const GROUND_Y = 720;
            const GRAVITY = 0.58;
            const MAX_GROUND_SPEED = 5.6;
            const GROUND_ACCEL = 0.75;
            const GROUND_FRICTION = 0.72;
            const AIR_ACCEL = 0.45;
            const JUMP_VEL = -12.8;
            const DASH_SPEED = 13.5;
            const DASH_FRAMES = 14;
            const DASH_COOLDOWN = 35;
            const DASH_INVULN = 22;
            const SPECIAL_COOLDOWN = 70;
            const PLAYER_MAX_HP = 100;
            const SLASH_TYPES = {
                LIGHT1: { windup: 5, active: 4, recovery: 9, damage: 12, hitStop: 3, range: 78, arc: 2.2,
                    knockback: 3.2, shake: 2, color: '#cdeeff' },
                LIGHT2: { windup: 4, active: 4, recovery: 9, damage: 13, hitStop: 3, range: 82, arc: 2.4,
                    knockback: 3.6, shake: 2.3, color: '#d8f3ff' },
                LIGHT3: { windup: 8, active: 6, recovery: 15, damage: 18, hitStop: 5, range: 90, arc: 2.7,
                    knockback: 7.5, shake: 3.5, color: '#ffffff', launch: true },
                HEAVY: { windup: 16, active: 5, recovery: 20, damage: 28, hitStop: 7, range: 100, arc: 2.5,
                    knockback: 10.5, shake: 5, color: '#ffe0a0', breakBonus: 1.0 },
                AIR: { windup: 5, active: 5, recovery: 8, damage: 15, hitStop: 4, range: 75, arc: 2.3,
                    knockback: 4.5, shake: 2.5, color: '#cceecc' },
                DASH_ATK: { windup: 3, active: 5, recovery: 7, damage: 20, hitStop: 5, range: 95, arc: 2.4,
                    knockback: 6.0, shake: 4, color: '#aaffee' },
            };
            const COMBO_WINDOW = 14;
            const PROJECTILE_SPEED = 9.5;
            const MAX_ENEMIES = 5;
            const ENEMY_RESPAWN_DELAY = 100;
            const HIT_FLASH_FRAMES = 4;

            // ==================== 游戏状态 ====================
            let canvas, ctx, cw, ch, scaleX, scaleY;
            let audioCtx = null;
            let muted = false;
            let gameState = 'start'; // 'start' | 'playing' | 'dead'
            let frameCount = 0;
            let hitCount = 0;
            let limbBreakCount = 0;
            let killCount = 0;
            let hitStopTimer = 0;
            let shakeAmount = 0;
            let shakeDuration = 0;
            let shakeX = 0;
            let shakeY = 0;
            let enemies = [];
            let particles = [];
            let slashes = [];
            let limbDebris = [];
            let projectiles = [];
            let enemyProjectiles = [];
            let respawnTimer = 0;
            let hurtFlashTimer = 0;
            let keys = {};
            let keysJustPressed = {};

            // ==================== 玩家对象 ====================
            const player = {
                x: 300,
                y: GROUND_Y,
                vx: 0,
                vy: 0,
                width: 34,
                height: 56,
                facing: 1,
                onGround: true,
                state: 'idle',
                stateTimer: 0,
                comboStep: 0,
                comboWindowTimer: 0,
                attackPhase: 'none',
                attackType: null,
                hitEnemies: [],
                dashTimer: 0,
                dashCdTimer: 0,
                invulnTimer: 0,
                specialCdTimer: 0,
                hp: PLAYER_MAX_HP,
                maxHp: PLAYER_MAX_HP,
                airJumps: 1,
                maxAirJumps: 1,
                hurtTimer: 0,
                wasDashing: false,
            };

            // ==================== 初始化 ====================
            function initCanvas() {
                canvas = document.getElementById('game-canvas');
                ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
                resizeCanvas();
                window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);
            }

            function resizeCanvas() {
                const container = document.getElementById('game-container');
                const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();
                const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);
                cw = rect.width;
                ch = rect.height;
                canvas.width = Math.floor(cw * dpr);
                canvas.height = Math.floor(ch * dpr);
                canvas.style.width = cw + 'px';
                canvas.style.height = ch + 'px';
                ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);
                scaleX = cw / W;
                scaleY = ch / H;
            }

            function resetGame() {
                player.x = 300;
                player.y = GROUND_Y;
                player.vx = 0;
                player.vy = 0;
                player.facing = 1;
                player.onGround = true;
                player.state = 'idle';
                player.stateTimer = 0;
                player.comboStep = 0;
                player.comboWindowTimer = 0;
                player.attackPhase = 'none';
                player.attackType = null;
                player.hitEnemies = [];
                player.dashTimer = 0;
                player.dashCdTimer = 0;
                player.invulnTimer = 0;
                player.specialCdTimer = 0;
                player.hp = PLAYER_MAX_HP;
                player.maxHp = PLAYER_MAX_HP;
                player.airJumps = player.maxAirJumps;
                player.hurtTimer = 0;
                player.wasDashing = false;
                enemies = [];
                particles = [];
                slashes = [];
                limbDebris = [];
                projectiles = [];
                enemyProjectiles = [];
                respawnTimer = 20;
                hitStopTimer = 0;
                shakeAmount = 0;
                shakeDuration = 0;
                hurtFlashTimer = 0;
                hitCount = 0;
                limbBreakCount = 0;
                killCount = 0;
                frameCount = 0;
                spawnEnemy(600, true);
                spawnEnemy(900, true);
                gameState = 'playing';
                document.getElementById('death-screen').style.display = 'none';
                document.getElementById('start-screen').style.display = 'none';
            }

            // ==================== 输入系统 ====================
            const preventKeys = new Set([' ', 'Space', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'KeyA', 'KeyD',
                'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyL', 'KeyI', 'KeyR', 'Enter'
            ]);

            document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
                const code = e.code;
                if (preventKeys.has(code) || code === 'Space') {
                    e.preventDefault();
                }
                if (!keys[code]) {
                    keysJustPressed[code] = true;
                }
                keys[code] = true;
                if (gameState === 'start' && (code === 'Enter' || code === 'Space')) {
                    initAudio();
                    resetGame();
                } else if (gameState === 'dead' && code === 'KeyR') {
                    resetGame();
                } else if (code === 'KeyR' && gameState === 'playing') {
                    resetGame();
                }
                if (gameState === 'playing' && (code === 'KeyJ' || code === 'KeyK' || code === 'KeyL' || code === 'KeyI' ||
                        code === 'Space')) {
                    initAudio();
                }
            });
            document.addEventListener('keyup', (e) => {
                keys[e.code] = false;
            });
            window.addEventListener('blur', () => {
                keys = {};
                keysJustPressed = {};
            });
            document.getElementById('btn-start').addEventListener('click', () => {
                initAudio();
                resetGame();
            });
            document.getElementById('btn-mute').addEventListener('click', () => {
                muted = !muted;
                document.getElementById('btn-mute').textContent = muted ? '🔇 静音' : '🔊 音效';
            });
            document.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {
                if (gameState === 'playing') initAudio();
            });

            function wasPressed(code) {
                if (keysJustPressed[code]) {
                    keysJustPressed[code] = false;
                    return true;
                }
                return false;
            }

            function clearJustPressed() {
                keysJustPressed = {};
            }

            // ==================== 音频系统 ====================
            function initAudio() {
                if (!audioCtx) {
                    try {
                        audioCtx = new(window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
                    } catch (e) {
                        audioCtx = null;
                    }
                }
                if (audioCtx && audioCtx.state === 'suspended') {
                    audioCtx.resume();
                }
            }

            function playSound(type, volume) {
                if (muted || !audioCtx) return;
                try {
                    const v = volume || 1;
                    const ctx2 = audioCtx;
                    const now = ctx2.currentTime;
                    if (type === 'slash') {
                        const dur = 0.09;
                        const bufferSize = Math.floor(ctx2.sampleRate * dur);
                        const buffer = ctx2.createBuffer(1, bufferSize, ctx2.sampleRate);
                        const data = buffer.getChannelData(0);
                        for (let i = 0; i < bufferSize; i++) {
                            const t = i / bufferSize;
                            data[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 40) * Math.sin(t * 50) * 0.5;
                        }
                        const src = ctx2.createBufferSource();
                        src.buffer = buffer;
                        const filter = ctx2.createBiquadFilter();
                        filter.type = 'bandpass';
                        filter.frequency.value = 2500 + Math.random() * 800;
                        filter.Q.value = 1.2;
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.5 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + dur);
                        src.connect(filter).connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        src.start(now);
                    } else if (type === 'hit') {
                        const dur = 0.14;
                        const bufferSize = Math.floor(ctx2.sampleRate * dur);
                        const buffer = ctx2.createBuffer(1, bufferSize, ctx2.sampleRate);
                        const data = buffer.getChannelData(0);
                        for (let i = 0; i < bufferSize; i++) {
                            const t = i / bufferSize;
                            data[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 28) * Math.sin(t * 180) * 0.7 + (Math.random() *
                                2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 18) * 0.35;
                        }
                        const src = ctx2.createBufferSource();
                        src.buffer = buffer;
                        const filter = ctx2.createBiquadFilter();
                        filter.type = 'lowpass';
                        filter.frequency.value = 800 + Math.random() * 400;
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.7 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + dur);
                        src.connect(filter).connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        src.start(now);
                    } else if (type === 'break') {
                        const dur = 0.22;
                        const bufferSize = Math.floor(ctx2.sampleRate * dur);
                        const buffer = ctx2.createBuffer(1, bufferSize, ctx2.sampleRate);
                        const data = buffer.getChannelData(0);
                        for (let i = 0; i < bufferSize; i++) {
                            const t = i / bufferSize;
                            data[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 16) * Math.sin(t * 220) * 0.8 + (Math.random() *
                                2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 12) * 0.4;
                        }
                        const src = ctx2.createBufferSource();
                        src.buffer = buffer;
                        const filter = ctx2.createBiquadFilter();
                        filter.type = 'lowpass';
                        filter.frequency.value = 500;
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.9 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + dur);
                        src.connect(filter).connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        src.start(now);
                    } else if (type === 'jump') {
                        const osc = ctx2.createOscillator();
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        osc.type = 'sine';
                        osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(260, now);
                        osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(480, now + 0.1);
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.35 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + 0.12);
                        osc.connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        osc.start(now);
                        osc.stop(now + 0.12);
                    } else if (type === 'dash') {
                        const dur = 0.15;
                        const bufferSize = Math.floor(ctx2.sampleRate * dur);
                        const buffer = ctx2.createBuffer(1, bufferSize, ctx2.sampleRate);
                        const data = buffer.getChannelData(0);
                        for (let i = 0; i < bufferSize; i++) {
                            const t = i / bufferSize;
                            data[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 22) * 0.4;
                        }
                        const src = ctx2.createBufferSource();
                        src.buffer = buffer;
                        const filter = ctx2.createBiquadFilter();
                        filter.type = 'highpass';
                        filter.frequency.value = 1200;
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.4 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + dur);
                        src.connect(filter).connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        src.start(now);
                    } else if (type === 'special') {
                        const osc = ctx2.createOscillator();
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        osc.type = 'sawtooth';
                        osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(180, now);
                        osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(420, now + 0.18);
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.3 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + 0.2);
                        osc.connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        osc.start(now);
                        osc.stop(now + 0.2);
                    } else if (type === 'hurt') {
                        const dur = 0.18;
                        const bufferSize = Math.floor(ctx2.sampleRate * dur);
                        const buffer = ctx2.createBuffer(1, bufferSize, ctx2.sampleRate);
                        const data = buffer.getChannelData(0);
                        for (let i = 0; i < bufferSize; i++) {
                            const t = i / bufferSize;
                            data[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * Math.exp(-t * 20) * 0.5 + Math.sin(t * 90) * Math.exp(-t *
                                15) * 0.3;
                        }
                        const src = ctx2.createBufferSource();
                        src.buffer = buffer;
                        const filter = ctx2.createBiquadFilter();
                        filter.type = 'lowpass';
                        filter.frequency.value = 300;
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.6 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + dur);
                        src.connect(filter).connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        src.start(now);
                    } else if (type === 'enemy_shoot') {
                        const osc = ctx2.createOscillator();
                        const gain = ctx2.createGain();
                        osc.type = 'square';
                        osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(180, now);
                        osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(80, now + 0.1);
                        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.15 * v, now);
                        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + 0.1);
                        osc.connect(gain).connect(ctx2.destination);
                        osc.start(now);
                        osc.stop(now + 0.1);
                    }
                } catch (e) { /* 静默忽略音频错误 */ }
            }

            // ==================== 粒子系统 ====================
            function spawnParticles(x, y, count, color, speed, spread, life, gravityScale, size) {
                for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
                    const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;
                    const spd = (Math.random() * 0.7 + 0.3) * speed;
                    particles.push({
                        x: x + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 12,
                        y: y + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 12,
                        vx: Math.cos(angle) * spd + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2,
                        vy: Math.sin(angle) * spd - Math.random() * 2,
                        life: (Math.random() * 0.6 + 0.4) * life,
                        maxLife: life,
                        size: (Math.random() * 0.6 + 0.5) * (size || 3),
                        color: color,
                        gravity: gravityScale || 0.08,
                        type: 'spark',
                    });
                }
            }

            function spawnLimbDebris(x, y, vx, vy, type, color) {
                limbDebris.push({
                    x: x,
                    y: y,
                    vx: vx + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 6,
                    vy: vy - Math.random() * 4,
                    rotation: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,
                    rotSpeed: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.4,
                    life: 80 + Math.random() * 30,
                    maxLife: 110,
                    type: type,
                    color: color || '#8a5a3a',
                    size: type === 'head' ? 16 : 22,
                });
            }

            function spawnHitSparks(x, y, angle, count, color) {
                for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
                    const a = angle + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1.8;
                    const spd = (Math.random() * 4 + 2);
                    particles.push({
                        x: x,
                        y: y,
                        vx: Math.cos(a) * spd,
                        vy: Math.sin(a) * spd - 1,
                        life: 18 + Math.random() * 16,
                        maxLife: 34,
                        size: (Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.5) * 3.5,
                        color: color || '#fff8e0',
                        gravity: 0.15,
                        type: 'spark',
                    });
                }
            }

            // ==================== 敌人系统 ====================
            function createEnemy(x, type) {
                const isMelee = type === 'melee' || (type !== 'ranged' && Math.random() < 0.65);
                const diff = Math.min(killCount * 0.03, 0.8);
                return {
                    x: x,
                    y: GROUND_Y,
                    vx: 0,
                    vy: 0,
                    width: 38,
                    height: 62,
                    type: isMelee ? 'melee' : 'ranged',
                    facing: -1,
                    state: 'idle',
                    stateTimer: 0,
                    onGround: true,
                    hp: 60 + diff * 40,
                    maxHp: 60 + diff * 40,
                    speed: 1.6 + diff * 0.5 + (isMelee ? 0.4 : 0),
                    attackCooldown: 0,
                    hitFlash: 0,
                    hitId: 0,
                    limbs: {
                        head: { hp: 18 + diff * 10, broken: false, maxHp: 18 + diff * 10 },
                        leftArm: { hp: 25 + diff * 12, broken: false, maxHp: 25 + diff * 12 },
                        rightArm: { hp: 25 + diff * 12, broken: false, maxHp: 25 + diff * 12 },
                        torso: { hp: 60 + diff * 40, broken: false, maxHp: 60 + diff * 40 },
                    },
                    limbOffset: {
                        head: { x: 0, y: -54 },
                        leftArm: { x: -23, y: -18 },
                        rightArm: { x: 23, y: -18 },
                    },
                    animFrame: Math.random() * 100,
                    shootTimer: 0,
                };
            }

            function spawnEnemy(x, immediate) {
                if (enemies.length >= MAX_ENEMIES) return;
                const type = Math.random() < 0.6 ? 'melee' : 'ranged';
                const e = createEnemy(x, type);
                if (immediate) {
                    e.x = Math.max(500, Math.min(W - 100, x));
                    enemies.push(e);
                } else {
                    e.x = W + 40;
                    e.state = 'approach';
                    enemies.push(e);
                }
            }

            function destroyEnemy(e, idx) {
                enemies.splice(idx, 1);
                killCount++;
                spawnParticles(e.x, e.y - 30, 35, '#ff6644', 7, 2, 50, 0.18, 4);
                spawnParticles(e.x, e.y - 30, 25, '#ffcc88', 5, 2, 40, 0.1, 3);
                spawnLimbDebris(e.x, e.y - 40, -e.facing * 3, -3, 'head', '#555566');
                spawnLimbDebris(e.x - 20, e.y - 20, -e.facing * 2.5, -4, 'arm', '#664444');
                spawnLimbDebris(e.x + 20, e.y - 20, -e.facing * 2.5, -4, 'arm', '#664444');
                respawnTimer = ENEMY_RESPAWN_DELAY;
            }

            function breakLimb(e, limbName, angle) {
                if (e.limbs[limbName].broken) return;
                e.limbs[limbName].broken = true;
                limbBreakCount++;
                const off = e.limbOffset[limbName];
                const wx = e.x + off.x;
                const wy = e.y + off.y;
                const dir = Math.sign(angle) || (e.facing || 1);
                spawnLimbDebris(wx, wy, dir * 5, -4, limbName === 'head' ? 'head' : 'arm',
                    limbName === 'head' ? '#888899' : '#775544');
                spawnParticles(wx, wy, 22, '#ffaa44', 6, 2, 35, 0.15, 3.5);
                spawnParticles(wx, wy, 14, '#ffdd88', 4, 2, 28, 0.08, 2.5);
                playSound('break', 0.9);
                hitStopTimer = Math.max(hitStopTimer, 10);
                shakeAmount = Math.max(shakeAmount, 5);
                shakeDuration = 12;
                e.hitFlash = HIT_FLASH_FRAMES;
                // 断肢影响行为
                if (limbName === 'head') {
                    e.hp = 0;
                    e.limbs.torso.broken = true;
                    const idx = enemies.indexOf(e);
                    if (idx >= 0) {
                        destroyEnemy(e, idx);
                    }
                } else if (limbName === 'leftArm' || limbName === 'rightArm') {
                    e.speed *= 0.5;
                    if (e.type === 'ranged') {
                        e.type = 'melee';
                        e.speed *= 0.8;
                    }
                    e.attackCooldown = Math.max(e.attackCooldown, 90);
                }
            }

            function damageEnemy(e, damage, angle, breakBonus, kbForce, launch) {
                e.hp -= damage;
                e.limbs.torso.hp -= damage;
                e.hitFlash = HIT_FLASH_FRAMES;
                hitCount++;
                // 检查断肢
                const bb = breakBonus || 0;
                const roll = Math.random();
                if (bb > 0.35 && !e.limbs.head.broken && roll < 0.25 + bb * 0.35) {
                    breakLimb(e, 'head', angle);
                } else if (bb > 0.15 && !e.limbs.leftArm.broken && roll < 0.3 + bb * 0.4) {
                    breakLimb(e, 'leftArm', angle);
                } else if (bb > 0.15 && !e.limbs.rightArm.broken && roll < 0.25 + bb * 0.35) {
                    breakLimb(e, 'rightArm', angle);
                } else if (bb > 0.4 && !e.limbs.torso.broken && roll < 0.15 + bb * 0.25) {
                    e.limbs.torso.broken = true;
                    e.hp = 0;
                    const idx = enemies.indexOf(e);
                    if (idx >= 0) destroyEnemy(e, idx);
                }
                // 击退
                if (e.hp > 0) {
                    const kb = kbForce || 3;
                    e.vx += Math.cos(angle) * kb;
                    e.vy += Math.sin(angle) * kb * 0.7 - (launch ? 6 : 1.5);
                    e.onGround = launch ? false : e.onGround;
                }
                if (e.hp <= 0) {
                    const idx = enemies.indexOf(e);
                    if (idx >= 0) destroyEnemy(e, idx);
                }
            }

            // ==================== 玩家攻击逻辑 ====================
            function startAttack(type) {
                const atk = SLASH_TYPES[type];
                if (!atk) return;
                player.state = 'attack';
                player.attackType = type;
                player.stateTimer = 0;
                player.attackPhase = 'windup';
                player.hitEnemies = [];
                player.comboStep = type === 'LIGHT1' ? 1 : type === 'LIGHT2' ? 2 : type === 'LIGHT3' ? 3 : 0;
                if (type === 'LIGHT1') player.comboWindowTimer = 0;
                if (type === 'LIGHT2') player.comboWindowTimer = 0;
                if (type === 'LIGHT3') player.comboWindowTimer = 0;
                if (type === 'HEAVY') player.comboWindowTimer = 0;
                playSound('slash', 0.35);
            }

            function processPlayerAttack() {
                const atk = SLASH_TYPES[player.attackType];
                if (!atk) return;
                if (player.attackPhase === 'windup') {
                    player.stateTimer++;
                    if (player.stateTimer >= atk.windup) {
                        player.attackPhase = 'active';
                        player.stateTimer = 0;
                        player.hitEnemies = [];
                        const range = atk.range;
                        const cx = player.x + player.facing * range * 0.55;
                        const cy = player.y - 22;
                        const angle = player.facing > 0 ? 0 : Math.PI;
                        const halfArc = atk.arc / 2;
                        // 添加刀光
                        slashes.push({
                            x: cx,
                            y: cy,
                            angle: angle,
                            radius: range * 0.7,
                            life: 10,
                            maxLife: 10,
                            color: atk.color,
                            width: 8 + atk.damage * 0.2,
                            facing: player.facing,
                            type: player.attackType,
                        });
                        // 检测命中
                        for (let i = enemies.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                            const e = enemies[i];
                            if (!e || e.hp <= 0) continue;
                            if (e.hitId === frameCount + '_' + player.attackType) continue;
                            const dx = e.x - player.x;
                            const dy = (e.y - 25) - (player.y - 22);
                            const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
                            if (dist < range + e.width * 0.5) {
                                const angTo = Math.atan2(dy, dx);
                                let angleDiff = Math.abs(angTo - angle);
                                if (angleDiff > Math.PI) angleDiff = Math.PI * 2 - angleDiff;
                                if (angleDiff < halfArc + 0.5 || dist < 45) {
                                    e.hitId = frameCount + '_' + player.attackType;
                                    const breakBonus = player.attackType === 'HEAVY' ? 0.85 : (
                                        player.attackType === 'LIGHT3' ? 0.45 : (
                                            player.attackType === 'DASH_ATK' ? 0.55 : 0.15
                                        )
                                    );
                                    damageEnemy(e, atk.damage, angTo, breakBonus, atk.knockback, atk.launch);
                                    const hitX = e.x + e.facing * 10;
                                    const hitY = e.y - 28;
                                    spawnHitSparks(hitX, hitY, angTo, 14, atk.color);
                                    spawnParticles(hitX, hitY, 6, '#ffcc66', 3, 1.5, 22, 0.1, 3);
                                    hitStopTimer = Math.max(hitStopTimer, atk.hitStop);
                                    shakeAmount = Math.max(shakeAmount, atk.shake);
                                    shakeDuration = Math.max(shakeDuration, 6);
                                    playSound('hit', 0.7);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                        // 更新玩家攻击状态
                        player.attackPhase = 'recovery';
                        player.stateTimer = 0;
                        if (player.comboStep > 0 && player.attackType !== 'HEAVY') {
                            const windowForThis = (player.attackType === 'LIGHT1' || player.attackType === 'LIGHT2' ||
                                player.attackType === 'LIGHT3') ? COMBO_WINDOW : 6;
                            player.comboWindowTimer = windowForThis;
                        }
                    }
                } else if (player.attackPhase === 'recovery') {
                    player.stateTimer++;
                    // 连击窗口内按J可以接下一段
                    if (player.comboWindowTimer > 0) {
                        player.comboWindowTimer--;
                        if ((player.comboStep === 1 && wasPressed('KeyJ')) || (player.comboStep === 2 && wasPressed(
                                'KeyJ'))) {
                            const nextType = player.comboStep === 1 ? 'LIGHT2' : 'LIGHT3';
                            startAttack(nextType);
                            return;
                        }
                        if (player.comboStep >= 1 && wasPressed('KeyK')) {
                            startAttack('HEAVY');
                            return;
                        }
                    }
                    if (player.stateTimer >= atk.recovery) {
                        player.state = 'idle';
                        player.attackPhase = 'none';
                        player.attackType = null;
                        player.comboStep = 0;
                        player.comboWindowTimer = 0;
                    }
                }
                clearJustPressed();
            }

            // ==================== 玩家移动与状态 ====================
            function updatePlayer() {
                if (player.hp <= 0) {
                    if (gameState === 'playing') {
                        gameState = 'dead';
                        document.getElementById('death-screen').style.display = 'flex';
                    }
                    return;
                }
                hurtFlashTimer = Math.max(0, hurtFlashTimer - 1);
                player.invulnTimer = Math.max(0, player.invulnTimer - 1);
                player.dashCdTimer = Math.max(0, player.dashCdTimer - 1);
                player.specialCdTimer = Math.max(0, player.specialCdTimer - 1);
                player.hurtTimer = Math.max(0, player.hurtTimer - 1);

                if (player.hurtTimer > 0) {
                    // 受击硬直
                    player.vx *= 0.85;
                    player.vy += GRAVITY;
                    player.x += player.vx;
                    player.y += player.vy;
                    if (player.y >= GROUND_Y) {
                        player.y = GROUND_Y;
                        player.vy = 0;
                        player.vx = 0;
                        player.onGround = true;
                    }
                    if (player.hurtTimer === 1) {
                        player.state = 'idle';
                    }
                    return;
                }

                const attacking = player.state === 'attack';
                const dashing = player.dashTimer > 0;
                const specialCasting = player.state === 'special';

                // 冲刺
                if (wasPressed('KeyL') && player.dashCdTimer <= 0 && !attacking && !dashing && !specialCasting) {
                    player.dashTimer = DASH_FRAMES;
                    player.dashCdTimer = DASH_COOLDOWN;
                    player.invulnTimer = DASH_INVULN;
                    player.wasDashing = true;
                    player.vx = player.facing * DASH_SPEED;
                    player.state = 'dash';
                    playSound('dash', 0.45);
                    spawnParticles(player.x - player.facing * 10, player.y - 16, 8, '#88ccff', 3, 1.5, 15, 0.05, 2.5);
                }

                // 跳跃
                if (wasPressed('Space')) {
                    if (player.onGround) {
                        player.vy = JUMP_VEL;
                        player.onGround = false;
                        player.airJumps = player.maxAirJumps;
                        playSound('jump', 0.35);
                        spawnParticles(player.x, player.y - 4, 6, '#cccccc', 2, 1, 12, 0.03, 2);
                    } else if (player.airJumps > 0) {
                        player.vy = JUMP_VEL * 0.72;
                        player.airJumps--;
                        playSound('jump', 0.28);
                        spawnParticles(player.x, player.y, 8, '#aabbcc', 2.5, 1.2, 14, 0.03, 2);
                    }
                }

                // 移动输入
                let moveInput = 0;
                if (keys['KeyA'] || keys['ArrowLeft']) moveInput = -1;
                if (keys['KeyD'] || keys['ArrowRight']) moveInput = 1;
                if (moveInput !== 0) player.facing = moveInput;

                if (!attacking && !dashing && !specialCasting) {
                    if (player.onGround) {
                        if (moveInput !== 0) {
                            player.vx += moveInput * GROUND_ACCEL;
                            if (Math.abs(player.vx) > MAX_GROUND_SPEED) player.vx = moveInput * MAX_GROUND_SPEED;
                            player.state = 'run';
                        } else {
                            player.vx *= GROUND_FRICTION;
                            if (Math.abs(player.vx) < 0.05) player.vx = 0;
                            if (player.vx === 0) player.state = 'idle';
                        }
                    } else {
                        if (moveInput !== 0) {
                            player.vx += moveInput * AIR_ACCEL;
                            if (Math.abs(player.vx) > MAX_GROUND_SPEED * 0.85) player.vx = moveInput * MAX_GROUND_SPEED *
                                0.85;
                        } else {
                            player.vx *= 0.95;
                        }
                    }
                } else if (dashing) {
                    player.dashTimer--;
                    if (player.dashTimer <= 0) {
                        player.dashTimer = 0;
                        if (player.onGround) player.state = 'idle';
                        else player.state = 'jump';
                    }
                } else if (specialCasting) {
                    player.vx *= 0.7;
                }

                // 重力
                if (!dashing || !player.onGround) {
                    player.vy += GRAVITY;
                }
                if (player.dashTimer > 0 && !player.onGround) {
                    player.vy *= 0.6;
                }

                // 攻击输入
                if (!attacking && !dashing && !specialCasting) {
                    if (wasPressed('KeyJ')) {
                        if (!player.onGround) {
                            startAttack('AIR');
                        } else if (player.dashTimer <= 0 && player.wasDashing) {
                            startAttack('DASH_ATK');
                            player.wasDashing = false;
                        } else {
                            startAttack('LIGHT1');
                        }
                    } else if (wasPressed('KeyK')) {
                        startAttack('HEAVY');
                    } else if (wasPressed('KeyI') && player.specialCdTimer <= 0) {
                        // 剑气
                        player.state = 'special';
                        player.stateTimer = 0;
                        player.specialCdTimer = SPECIAL_COOLDOWN;
                        playSound('special', 0.5);
                        const projX = player.x + player.facing * 40;
                        const projY = player.y - 22;
                        projectiles.push({
                            x: projX,
                            y: projY,
                            vx: player.facing * PROJECTILE_SPEED,
                            vy: 0,
                            life: 70,
                            maxLife: 70,
                            radius: 16,
                            damage: 22,
                            breakBonus: 0.4,
                            color: '#88ddff',
                        });
                        spawnParticles(projX, projY, 10, '#aaddff', 4, 1.8, 20, 0.04, 3);
                        // 剑气刀光
                        slashes.push({
                            x: projX,
                            y: projY,
                            angle: player.facing > 0 ? 0 : Math.PI,
                            radius: 50,
                            life: 8,
                            maxLife: 8,
                            color: '#aaddff',
                            width: 14,
                            facing: player.facing,
                            type: 'SPECIAL',
                        });
                    }
                }

                // 冲刺中攻击（冲刺斩）
                if (dashing && wasPressed('KeyJ')) {
                    player.dashTimer = 0;
                    startAttack('DASH_ATK');
                    player.wasDashing = false;
                }

                // 特殊状态计时
                if (player.state === 'special') {
                    player.stateTimer++;
                    if (player.stateTimer > 18) {
                        player.state = 'idle';
                    }
                }

                // 攻击处理
                if (attacking) {
                    processPlayerAttack();
                }

                // 更新位置
                player.x += player.vx;
                player.y += player.vy;

                // 地面碰撞
                if (player.y >= GROUND_Y) {
                    if (!player.onGround && player.vy > 3) {
                        spawnParticles(player.x, player.y - 2, 5, '#999999', 2, 1, 10, 0.05, 2);
                    }
                    player.y = GROUND_Y;
                    player.vy = 0;
                    player.onGround = true;
                    player.airJumps = player.maxAirJumps;
                    if (player.state === 'jump') player.state = 'idle';
                } else {
                    player.onGround = false;
                    if (!attacking && !dashing && !specialCasting) player.state = 'jump';
                }

                // 边界
                if (player.x < 40) player.x = 40;
                if (player.x > W - 40) player.x = W - 40;

                // 玩家受击检测与敌人碰撞
                if (player.invulnTimer <= 0 && player.hurtTimer <= 0 && !dashing) {
                    for (const e of enemies) {
                        if (!e || e.hp <= 0) continue;
                        const dx = player.x - e.x;
                        const dy = (player.y - 25) - (e.y - 25);
                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
                        if (dist < (player.width + e.width) * 0.65) {
                            damagePlayer(12, Math.sign(player.x - e.x) || 1);
                            break;
                        }
                    }
                    for (const ep of enemyProjectiles) {
                        const dx = player.x - ep.x;
                        const dy = (player.y - 25) - ep.y;
                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
                        if (dist < (player.width * 0.5 + ep.radius)) {
                            damagePlayer(10, Math.sign(ep.vx) || 1);
                            ep.life = 0;
                            break;
                        }
                    }
                }

                player.wasDashing = dashing || player.dashTimer > 0;
                if (!dashing && player.dashTimer <= 0) player.wasDashing = false;
                clearJustPressed();
            }

            function damagePlayer(amount, dir) {
                if (player.invulnTimer > 0 || player.hurtTimer > 0) return;
                player.hp -= amount;
                player.hurtTimer = 14;
                player.invulnTimer = 36;
                player.vx = dir * 6;
                player.vy = -3.5;
                player.onGround = false;
                player.state = 'hurt';
                player.attackPhase = 'none';
                player.attackType = null;
                player.comboStep = 0;
                hurtFlashTimer = 8;
                shakeAmount = Math.max(shakeAmount, 4);
                shakeDuration = 10;
                playSound('hurt', 0.7);
                spawnParticles(player.x, player.y - 25, 12, '#ff4444', 4, 2, 18, 0.12, 3);
                if (player.hp <= 0) {
                    player.hp = 0;
                    gameState = 'dead';
                    document.getElementById('death-screen').style.display = 'flex';
                    spawnParticles(player.x, player.y - 25, 40, '#ff2222', 8, 2, 55, 0.15, 4);
                    spawnParticles(player.x, player.y - 25, 25, '#ffaa44', 5, 2, 40, 0.1, 3);
                }
            }

            // ==================== 敌人更新 ====================
            function updateEnemies() {
                for (let i = enemies.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    const e = enemies[i];
                    if (!e || e.hp <= 0) {
                        if (e && e.hp <= 0) destroyEnemy(e, i);
                        else enemies.splice(i, 1);
                        continue;
                    }
                    e.hitFlash = Math.max(0, e.hitFlash - 1);
                    e.attackCooldown = Math.max(0, e.attackCooldown - 1);
                    e.shootTimer = Math.max(0, e.shootTimer - 1);
                    e.animFrame++;
                    e.facing = player.x < e.x ? -1 : 1;

                    const hasWeaponArm = !e.limbs.leftArm.broken && !e.limbs.rightArm.broken;
                    const hasLeftArm = !e.limbs.leftArm.broken;
                    const hasRightArm = !e.limbs.rightArm.broken;

                    if (e.state === 'hurt' || e.hitFlash > 0) {
                        // 受击硬直
                        e.vx *= 0.8;
                        e.vy += GRAVITY;
                        if (e.state === 'hurt') {
                            e.stateTimer--;
                            if (e.stateTimer <= 0) e.state = 'idle';
                        }
                        if (e.hitFlash <= 0 && e.state !== 'hurt') e.state = 'idle';
                    } else {
                        const distToPlayer = Math.abs(player.x - e.x);
                        const dxP = player.x - e.x;

                        if (e.type === 'melee') {
                            if (hasLeftArm && hasRightArm && e.attackCooldown <= 0 && distToPlayer < 70 && player.y >
                                GROUND_Y - 80) {
                                // 近战攻击前摇
                                e.state = 'windup';
                                e.stateTimer = 0;
                                if (distToPlayer < 70 && Math.abs(player.y - e.y) < 30) {
                                    e.state = 'windup';
                                    e.stateTimer++;
                                    if (e.stateTimer > 22) {
                                        // 攻击
                                        e.state = 'attack_active';
                                        e.stateTimer = 0;
                                        e.attackCooldown = 60 + Math.random() * 30;
                                        playSound('slash', 0.2);
                                        // 攻击判定
                                        const atkRange = 62;
                                        const atkDx = player.x - e.x;
                                        const atkDy = (player.y - 25) - (e.y - 25);
                                        const atkDist = Math.sqrt(atkDx * atkDx + atkDy * atkDy);
                                        if (atkDist < atkRange + player.width * 0.5) {
                                            const dir = Math.sign(player.x - e.x) || e.facing;
                                            damagePlayer(13 + Math.floor(killCount * 0.4), dir);
                                        }
                                    }
                                } else {
                                    e.state = 'approach';
                                }
                            } else if (distToPlayer > 90 || !hasWeaponArm) {
                                e.state = 'approach';
                                if (hasWeaponArm) {
                                    e.vx = (dxP > 0 ? 1 : -1) * e.speed * (hasLeftArm && hasRightArm ? 1 : 0.55);
                                } else {
                                    e.vx = (dxP > 0 ? 1 : -1) * e.speed * 0.35;
                                }
                            } else if (e.state !== 'windup' && e.state !== 'attack_active') {
                                e.state = 'idle';
                                e.vx *= 0.85;
                            }
                        } else {
                            // 远程敌人
                            if (distToPlayer > 220) {
                                e.state = 'approach';
                                e.vx = (dxP > 0 ? 1 : -1) * e.speed * 0.85;
                            } else if (distToPlayer < 140) {
                                e.state = 'retreat';
                                e.vx = (dxP > 0 ? -1 : 1) * e.speed * 0.6;
                            } else {
                                e.vx *= 0.9;
                                if (hasLeftArm && hasRightArm && e.shootTimer <= 0 && Math.abs(player.y - e.y) < 100) {
                                    e.state = 'shoot_windup';
                                    e.stateTimer++;
                                    if (e.stateTimer > 16) {
                                        // 射击
                                        e.state = 'shoot';
                                        e.stateTimer = 0;
                                        e.shootTimer = 80 + Math.random() * 40;
                                        playSound('enemy_shoot', 0.45);
                                        const epSpeed = 5.5 + Math.min(killCount * 0.1, 2);
                                        enemyProjectiles.push({
                                            x: e.x + e.facing * 18,
                                            y: e.y - 30,
                                            vx: e.facing * epSpeed,
                                            vy: (player.y - 25 - (e.y - 30)) * 0.04,
                                            life: 110,
                                            maxLife: 110,
                                            radius: 7,
                                            color: '#ff6644',
                                        });
                                    }
                                } else {
                                    e.state = 'idle';
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }

                    // 重力与碰撞
                    e.vy += GRAVITY;
                    e.x += e.vx;
                    e.y += e.vy;
                    if (e.y >= GROUND_Y) {
                        e.y = GROUND_Y;
                        e.vy = 0;
                        e.onGround = true;
                    } else {
                        e.onGround = false;
                    }
                    if (e.x < 60) e.vx = Math.abs(e.vx);
                    if (e.x > W - 60) e.vx = -Math.abs(e.vx);

                    // 状态计时
                    if (e.state === 'attack_active') {
                        e.stateTimer++;
                        if (e.stateTimer > 10) e.state = 'idle';
                    }
                    if (e.state === 'windup') {
                        e.stateTimer++;
                        if (e.stateTimer > 26) {
                            e.state = 'attack_active';
                            e.stateTimer = 0;
                            e.attackCooldown = 50 + Math.random() * 30;
                            playSound('slash', 0.22);
                            const atkDx = player.x - e.x;
                            const atkDy = (player.y - 25) - (e.y - 25);
                            const atkDist = Math.sqrt(atkDx * atkDx + atkDy * atkDy);
                            if (atkDist < 65 + player.width * 0.5) {
                                const dir = Math.sign(player.x - e.x) || e.facing;
                                damagePlayer(12 + Math.floor(killCount * 0.35), dir);
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    if (e.state === 'shoot_windup') {
                        if (e.shootTimer > 0 || Math.abs(player.x - e.x) > 280) e.state = 'idle';
                    }
                    if (e.state === 'shoot') {
                        e.stateTimer++;
                        if (e.stateTimer > 12) e.state = 'idle';
                    }
                    if (e.state === 'hurt') {
                        e.stateTimer--;
                        if (e.stateTimer <= 0) e.state = 'idle';
                    }
                }
                // 刷新敌人
                if (respawnTimer > 0) {
                    respawnTimer--;
                    if (respawnTimer <= 0 && enemies.length < MAX_ENEMIES) {
                        spawnEnemy(W + 60, false);
                        respawnTimer = ENEMY_RESPAWN_DELAY - Math.min(killCount * 2, 50);
                    }
                } else {
                    if (enemies.length < MAX_ENEMIES && enemies.length > 0) {
                        respawnTimer = ENEMY_RESPAWN_DELAY - Math.min(killCount * 2, 50);
                    } else if (enemies.length === 0) {
                        respawnTimer = 20;
                    }
                }
            }

            // ==================== 更新所有 ====================
            function updateProjectiles() {
                for (let i = projectiles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    const p = projectiles[i];
                    p.x += p.vx;
                    p.y += p.vy;
                    p.life--;
                    if (p.life <= 0 || p.x < -50 || p.x > W + 50) {
                        projectiles.splice(i, 1);
                        continue;
                    }
                    // 剑气命中检测
                    for (const e of enemies) {
                        if (!e || e.hp <= 0) continue;
                        const dx = p.x - e.x;
                        const dy = p.y - (e.y - 25);
                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
                        if (dist < p.radius + e.width * 0.5) {
                            const ang = Math.atan2(dy, dx);
                            damageEnemy(e, p.damage, ang, p.breakBonus, 4, true);
                            spawnHitSparks(p.x, p.y, ang, 12, p.color);
                            hitStopTimer = Math.max(hitStopTimer, 4);
                            shakeAmount = Math.max(shakeAmount, 3);
                            shakeDuration = 6;
                            playSound('hit', 0.6);
                            p.life = 0;
                            projectiles.splice(i, 1);
                            break;
                        }
                    }
                }
                for (let i = enemyProjectiles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    const ep = enemyProjectiles[i];
                    ep.x += ep.vx;
                    ep.y += ep.vy;
                    ep.life--;
                    if (ep.life <= 0 || ep.x < -30 || ep.x > W + 30 || ep.y > GROUND_Y + 10) {
                        enemyProjectiles.splice(i, 1);
                    }
                }
            }

            function updateParticles() {
                for (let i = particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    const p = particles[i];
                    p.x += p.vx;
                    p.y += p.vy;
                    p.vy += p.gravity;
                    p.life--;
                    if (p.life <= 0) {
                        particles.splice(i, 1);
                    }
                }
                for (let i = slashes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    slashes[i].life--;
                    if (slashes[i].life <= 0) slashes.splice(i, 1);
                }
                for (let i = limbDebris.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    const d = limbDebris[i];
                    d.x += d.vx;
                    d.y += d.vy;
                    d.vy += 0.3;
                    d.rotation += d.rotSpeed;
                    d.life--;
                    if (d.life <= 0 || d.y > GROUND_Y + 100) limbDebris.splice(i, 1);
                }
            }

            function updateCamera() {
                shakeDuration = Math.max(0, shakeDuration - 1);
                if (shakeDuration > 0) {
                    const intensity = shakeAmount * (shakeDuration / 12);
                    shakeX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2 * intensity;
                    shakeY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2 * intensity;
                } else {
                    shakeX = 0;
                    shakeY = 0;
                    shakeAmount = Math.max(0, shakeAmount - 0.3);
                }
            }

            function updateGame() {
                if (gameState !== 'playing') return;
                frameCount++;
                if (hitStopTimer > 0) {
                    hitStopTimer--;
                    clearJustPressed();
                    return;
                }
                updatePlayer();
                updateEnemies();
                updateProjectiles();
                updateParticles();
                updateCamera();
                updateUI();
                clearJustPressed();
            }

            function updateUI() {
                const hpPct = Math.max(0, player.hp / player.maxHp * 100);
                document.getElementById('hp-bar').style.width = hpPct + '%';
                document.getElementById('kill-count').textContent = '斩敌: ' + killCount + ' | 断肢: ' + limbBreakCount;
                const dashPct = player.dashCdTimer > 0 ? (player.dashCdTimer / DASH_COOLDOWN * 100) : 0;
                const specPct = player.specialCdTimer > 0 ? (player.specialCdTimer / SPECIAL_COOLDOWN * 100) : 0;
                document.querySelector('#cd-dash .cd-fill').style.height = (100 - dashPct) + '%';
                document.querySelector('#cd-special .cd-fill').style.height = (100 - specPct) + '%';
            }

            // ==================== 渲染 ====================
            function drawBackground() {
                // 天空渐变
                const bgGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, H);
                bgGrad.addColorStop(0, '#0a0a18');
                bgGrad.addColorStop(0.55, '#141425');
                bgGrad.addColorStop(0.78, '#1e1a28');
                bgGrad.addColorStop(1, '#252030');
                ctx.fillStyle = bgGrad;
                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);

                // 远山轮廓
                ctx.fillStyle = '#151522';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(0, GROUND_Y - 80);
                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(200, GROUND_Y - 150, 420, GROUND_Y - 70);
                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(650, GROUND_Y - 170, 850, GROUND_Y - 60);
                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(1050, GROUND_Y - 140, 1250, GROUND_Y - 55);
                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(1450, GROUND_Y - 120, W, GROUND_Y - 40);
                ctx.lineTo(W, GROUND_Y + 10);
                ctx.lineTo(0, GROUND_Y + 10);
                ctx.closePath();
                ctx.fill();

                // 地面
                const groundGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, GROUND_Y, 0, H);
                groundGrad.addColorStop(0, '#2a2438');
                groundGrad.addColorStop(0.3, '#1e1825');
                groundGrad.addColorStop(1, '#120e18');
                ctx.fillStyle = groundGrad;
                ctx.fillRect(0, GROUND_Y, W, H - GROUND_Y);

                // 地面线
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#4a4060';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(0, GROUND_Y);
                ctx.lineTo(W, GROUND_Y);
                ctx.stroke();

                // 地面纹理线
                ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(70,60,90,0.4)';
                ctx.lineWidth = 1;
                for (let i = 0; i < W; i += 80) {
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.moveTo(i, GROUND_Y);
                    ctx.lineTo(i + 20, GROUND_Y + 20);
                    ctx.stroke();
                }

                // 背景灯笼
                for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
                    const lx = 150 + i * 310;
                    const ly = GROUND_Y - 180 - Math.sin(i * 1.2) * 40;
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(40,32,50,0.8)';
                    ctx.fillRect(lx - 3, ly, 6, 40);
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,100,50,0.25)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(lx, ly - 8, 18 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.03 + i) * 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(200,80,40,0.6)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(lx, ly - 8, 10 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.03 + i) * 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,180,80,0.9)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(lx, ly - 8, 5 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.03 + i) * 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                }
            }

            function drawPlayer() {
                const px = player.x;
                const py = player.y;
                const f = player.facing;
                const attacking = player.state === 'attack';
                const dashing = player.dashTimer > 0;
                const hurt = player.hurtTimer > 0;
                const invuln = player.invulnTimer > 0;
                const specialCasting = player.state === 'special';

                if (invuln && !hurt && player.hurtTimer === 0 && Math.floor(frameCount / 3) % 2 === 0) {
                    ctx.globalAlpha = 0.55;
                }

                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(px, py);
                if (hurt) {
                    ctx.rotate(Math.sin(frameCount * 0.8) * 0.12);
                }

                const atkType = player.attackType;
                const atkPhase = player.attackPhase;
                let bodyRot = 0;
                let armAngle = 0;
                let legOffset = 0;
                let leanFwd = 0;

                if (attacking && atkType) {
                    const atk = SLASH_TYPES[atkType];
                    if (atkPhase === 'windup') {
                        const progress = player.stateTimer / atk.windup;
                        if (atkType === 'HEAVY') {
                            bodyRot = -f * 0.5 * Math.sin(progress * Math.PI * 0.5);
                            armAngle = -f * (1.6 - progress * 0.8);
                            leanFwd = -f * 2 * progress;
                        } else if (atkType === 'LIGHT3') {
                            bodyRot = f * 0.3 * progress;
                            armAngle = -f * (0.8 + progress * 0.7);
                        } else {
                            bodyRot = f * 0.25 * progress;
                            armAngle = -f * (0.6 + progress * 0.8);
                        }
                    } else if (atkPhase === 'active') {
                        const t = player.stateTimer;
                        if (atkType === 'HEAVY') {
                            bodyRot = f * (0.6 - t * 0.15);
                            armAngle = f * (1.2 + t * 0.4);
                            leanFwd = f * 4;
                        } else if (atkType === 'LIGHT3') {
                            bodyRot = f * 0.4;
                            armAngle = f * (1.4 + t * 0.2);
                        } else if (atkType === 'DASH_ATK') {
                            bodyRot = f * 0.45;
                            armAngle = f * 1.0;
                            leanFwd = f * 6;
                        } else {
                            bodyRot = f * 0.35;
                            armAngle = f * (0.9 + t * 0.15);
                        }
                    } else {
                        const progress = player.stateTimer / atk.recovery;
                        bodyRot = f * 0.3 * (1 - progress);
                        armAngle = f * 0.5 * (1 - progress);
                        if (atkType === 'HEAVY') leanFwd = f * 3 * (1 - progress);
                    }
                } else if (dashing) {
                    leanFwd = f * 8;
                    bodyRot = f * 0.3;
                } else if (specialCasting) {
                    armAngle = f * 1.3;
                    bodyRot = f * 0.2;
                    leanFwd = f * 2;
                } else if (player.state === 'run') {
                    const runCycle = frameCount * 0.28;
                    legOffset = Math.sin(runCycle) * 8;
                    leanFwd = f * 2.5;
                    bodyRot = f * 0.1;
                } else if (!player.onGround) {
                    legOffset = 4;
                    leanFwd = f * 1.5;
                }

                // 阴影
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.45)';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.ellipse(0, 4, 22, 7, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();

                // 腿
                const legColor = '#2c2c3e';
                ctx.fillStyle = legColor;
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#4a4a5e';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                const legLen = 22;
                const legThick = 8;
                // 左腿
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(-7, -legLen);
                if (!player.onGround) {
                    ctx.rotate(f * 0.3 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.3) * 0.15);
                } else if (player.state === 'run') {
                    ctx.rotate(Math.sin(frameCount * 0.28) * 0.55);
                }
                ctx.fillRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.strokeRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.restore();
                // 右腿
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(7, -legLen);
                if (!player.onGround) {
                    ctx.rotate(f * 0.3 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.3 + 2) * 0.15);
                } else if (player.state === 'run') {
                    ctx.rotate(Math.sin(frameCount * 0.28 + Math.PI) * 0.55);
                }
                ctx.fillRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.strokeRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.restore();

                // 身体
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(0, -34);
                ctx.rotate(bodyRot);
                const bodyGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(-14, -30, 14, 0);
                bodyGrad.addColorStop(0, '#3a3a4e');
                bodyGrad.addColorStop(0.5, '#2e2e3e');
                bodyGrad.addColorStop(1, '#22222e');
                ctx.fillStyle = bodyGrad;
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#5a5a78';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.roundRect(-13, -32, 26, 36, 5);
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.stroke();
                // 护甲装饰
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(160,180,200,0.3)';
                ctx.fillRect(-6, -26, 12, 8);
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(200,220,255,0.25)';
                ctx.fillRect(-4, -22, 8, 3);

                // 头部
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(0, -40);
                ctx.fillStyle = '#3f3f52';
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#6a6a85';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(0, 0, 14, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.stroke();
                // 面白
                ctx.fillStyle = '#e8e0d0';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(f * 3, -1, 7, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();
                // 眼睛
                ctx.fillStyle = '#222';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(f * 5, -2, 2.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();
                // 头带
                ctx.fillStyle = '#cc3333';
                ctx.fillRect(-12, -8, 24, 4);
                // 头带飘带
                ctx.fillStyle = '#cc3333';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(-10, -7);
                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(-18 - Math.sin(frameCount * 0.1) * 4, -10, -22 - Math.sin(frameCount * 0.1) * 3, -
                    4);
                ctx.lineTo(-10, -4);
                ctx.closePath();
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.restore();

                // 手臂和刀
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(f * 10, -26);
                ctx.rotate(armAngle);
                // 手臂
                ctx.fillStyle = '#333348';
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#555570';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(f * 6, -4);
                ctx.fillRect(-4, -4, 8, 22);
                ctx.strokeRect(-4, -4, 8, 22);
                ctx.restore();
                // 刀
                const bladeLen = 46;
                const bladeW = 5;
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(f * 10, -16);
                ctx.rotate(f * 0.15);
                const bladeGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, -bladeW, 0, bladeW * 3);
                bladeGrad.addColorStop(0, '#e8e8f0');
                bladeGrad.addColorStop(0.5, '#c0c0d0');
                bladeGrad.addColorStop(1, '#8888a0');
                ctx.fillStyle = bladeGrad;
                ctx.fillRect(-bladeW / 2, -bladeLen, bladeW, bladeLen);
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#aaaacc';
                ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;
                ctx.strokeRect(-bladeW / 2, -bladeLen, bladeW, bladeLen);
                // 刀柄
                ctx.fillStyle = '#4a3a2a';
                ctx.fillRect(-bladeW / 2 + 1, -2, bladeW - 2, 10);
                ctx.restore();
                ctx.restore();
                ctx.restore();

                // 剑气投射物已经在projectiles数组里，单独渲染
                ctx.restore();

                // 冲刺轨迹
                if (dashing) {
                    const trailX = player.x - player.facing * 6;
                    const trailY = player.y - 22;
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(150,200,255,0.3)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(trailX - player.facing * 8, trailY, 10, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(180,220,255,0.2)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(trailX - player.facing * 18, trailY, 7, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                }

                if (invuln && !hurt && player.hurtTimer === 0 && Math.floor(frameCount / 3) % 2 === 0) {
                    ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                }
                if (player.hurtTimer > 0) {
                    ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                }
            }

            function drawEnemy(e) {
                if (!e || e.hp <= 0) return;
                const ex = e.x;
                const ey = e.y;
                const f = e.facing;
                const hurt = e.hitFlash > 0;
                const hasHead = !e.limbs.head.broken;
                const hasLeftArm = !e.limbs.leftArm.broken;
                const hasRightArm = !e.limbs.rightArm.broken;
                const isMelee = e.type === 'melee';

                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(ex, ey);

                // 阴影
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.4)';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.ellipse(0, 3, 24, 8, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();

                // 受击闪白
                if (hurt) {
                    ctx.shadowColor = '#fff';
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 16;
                }

                // 腿
                const legColor = '#4a3a30';
                ctx.fillStyle = legColor;
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#6a5a45';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                const legLen = 20;
                const legThick = 7;
                const legSwing = e.state === 'approach' || e.state === 'retreat' ? Math.sin(e.animFrame * 0.25) * 6 :
                    Math.sin(e.animFrame * 0.1) * 1.5;
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(-8, -legLen);
                ctx.rotate(legSwing * 0.04);
                ctx.fillRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.strokeRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.restore();
                ctx.save();
                ctx.translate(8, -legLen);
                ctx.rotate(-legSwing * 0.04);
                ctx.fillRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.strokeRect(-legThick / 2, 0, legThick, legLen);
                ctx.restore();

                // 躯干
                const torsoGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(-16, -35, 16, -10);
                torsoGrad.addColorStop(0, '#5a4a3a');
                torsoGrad.addColorStop(0.5, '#4a3a2e');
                torsoGrad.addColorStop(1, '#3a2e24');
                ctx.fillStyle = torsoGrad;
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#7a6a55';
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.roundRect(-15, -36, 30, 38, 4);
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.stroke();
                // 躯干装饰
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,120,50,0.25)';
                ctx.fillRect(-8, -28, 16, 5);
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(200,100,40,0.35)';
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(0, -12, 5 + Math.sin(e.animFrame * 0.05) * 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();

                // 头部
                if (hasHead) {
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.translate(0, -46);
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#6a5a45';
                    ctx.strokeStyle = '#8a7a60';
                    ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.roundRect(-10, -14, 20, 18, 5);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.stroke();
                    // 眼睛
                    const eyeGlow = e.state === 'windup' || e.state === 'shoot_windup' ? 1 : 0.5;
                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255,50,30,${eyeGlow})`;
                    ctx.shadowColor = '#ff5533';
                    ctx.shadowBlur = e.state === 'windup' ? 12 : 6;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(f * 3, -5, 3.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(f * 6, -5, 2.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
                    // 头冠/饰
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#8a7050';
                    ctx.fillRect(-9, -16, 18, 4);
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#cc4444';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(0, -17, 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.restore();
                } else {
                    // 断头处
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#3a2e24';
                    ctx.fillRect(-8, -38, 16, 8);
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff8844';
                    ctx.shadowColor = '#ff6622';
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 10;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(0, -36, 4 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.3) * 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
                }

                // 左臂
                if (hasLeftArm) {
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.translate(-18, -24);
                    if (e.state === 'windup') {
                        ctx.rotate(-f * (0.8 + Math.sin(player.stateTimer * 0.2) * 0.2));
                    } else if (e.state === 'attack_active') {
                        ctx.rotate(f * 0.9);
                    } else {
                        ctx.rotate(-f * 0.2 + Math.sin(e.animFrame * 0.08) * 0.1);
                    }
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#5a4a3a';
                    ctx.strokeStyle = '#7a6a50';
                    ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                    ctx.fillRect(-4, -4, 8, 22);
                    ctx.strokeRect(-4, -4, 8, 22);
                    // 手/武器
                    if (isMelee && hasLeftArm) {
                        ctx.fillStyle = '#8a8a9a';
                        ctx.fillRect(-3, -18, 6, 16);
                        ctx.fillStyle = '#ccd';
                        ctx.fillRect(-2, -22, 4, 5);
                    }
                    ctx.restore();
                    // 左臂断口火花(如果刚断)
                } else {
                    // 断臂处火花
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff8844';
                    ctx.shadowColor = '#ff6622';
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 8;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(-18, -24, 3 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.5) * 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
                }

                // 右臂
                if (hasRightArm) {
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.translate(18, -24);
                    if (e.state === 'windup') {
                        ctx.rotate(f * (0.5 + Math.sin(player.stateTimer * 0.2) * 0.2));
                    } else if (e.state === 'attack_active') {
                        ctx.rotate(-f * 0.6);
                    } else {
                        ctx.rotate(f * 0.15 + Math.sin(e.animFrame * 0.08 + 2) * 0.1);
                    }
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#5a4a3a';
                    ctx.strokeStyle = '#7a6a50';
                    ctx.lineWidth = 2;
                    ctx.fillRect(-4, -4, 8, 22);
                    ctx.strokeRect(-4, -4, 8, 22);
                    if (!isMelee && hasRightArm) {
                        ctx.fillStyle = '#aa5533';
                        ctx.fillRect(-4, -10, 8, 8);
                        ctx.fillStyle = '#cc8866';
                        ctx.fillRect(-3, -14, 6, 4);
                    }
                    ctx.restore();
                } else {
                    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff8844';
                    ctx.shadowColor = '#ff6622';
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 8;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(18, -24, 3 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.5 + 1) * 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
                }

                // 攻击前兆警告
                if (e.state === 'windup' || e.state === 'shoot_windup') {
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,80,40,0.5)';
                    if (e.type === 'melee') {
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.arc(f * 28, -25, 18 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.2) * 5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    } else {
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.arc(f * 20, -30, 14 + Math.sin(frameCount * 0.2) * 4, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    }
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,200,100,0.7)';
                    ctx.font = 'bold 22px sans-serif';
                    ctx.fillText('!', f * 26, -20);
                }

                ctx.restore();
                if (hurt) ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
            }

            function drawSlashes() {
                for (const s of slashes) {
                    const alpha = s.life / s.maxLife;
                    const radius = s.radius * (0.5 + (1 - alpha) * 0.6);
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.translate(s.x, s.y);
                    ctx.rotate(s.angle);
                    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(0, 0, 5, 0, 0, radius);
                    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,' + (alpha * 0.85) + ')');
                    grad.addColorStop(0.3, s.color + Math.floor(alpha * 180).toString(16).padStart(2, '0'));
                    grad.addColorStop(0.7, s.color + Math.floor(alpha * 80).toString(16).padStart(2, '0'));
                    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255,255,255,0)');
                    ctx.fillStyle = grad;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    if (s.type === 'SPECIAL') {
                        ctx.arc(0, 0, radius, -Math.PI * 0.8, Math.PI * 0.8);
                        ctx.closePath();
                    } else {
                        const halfW = s.width * alpha;
                        ctx.moveTo(0, -halfW);
                        ctx.quadraticCurveTo(radius * 0.7, 0, radius, halfW * 0.4);
                        ctx.lineTo(radius * 0.9, halfW * 0.3);
                        ctx.quadraticCurveTo(radius * 0.6, 0, 0, halfW * 0.1);
                        ctx.closePath();
                    }
                    ctx.fill();
                    // 边缘亮线
                    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,' + (alpha * 0.7) + ')';
                    ctx.lineWidth = 2 * alpha;
                    ctx.stroke();
                    ctx.restore();
                }
            }

            function drawProjectiles() {
                for (const p of projectiles) {
                    const alpha = p.life / p.maxLife;
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.translate(p.x, p.y);
                    ctx.rotate(Math.atan2(p.vy, p.vx));
                    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(0, 0, 3, 0, 0, p.radius * 1.5);
                    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,' + (alpha * 0.9) + ')');
                    grad.addColorStop(0.4, p.color + Math.floor(alpha * 200).toString(16).padStart(2, '0'));
                    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(150,220,255,0)');
                    ctx.fillStyle = grad;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(0, 0, p.radius * 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,' + (alpha * 0.8) + ')';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.ellipse(0, 0, p.radius, p.radius * 0.5, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.restore();
                }
                for (const ep of enemyProjectiles) {
                    const alpha = ep.life / ep.maxLife;
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.translate(ep.x, ep.y);
                    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(0, 0, 2, 0, 0, ep.radius * 2);
                    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,200,150,' + (alpha * 0.95) + ')');
                    grad.addColorStop(0.5, ep.color + Math.floor(alpha * 200).toString(16).padStart(2, '0'));
                    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255,100,50,0)');
                    ctx.fillStyle = grad;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(0, 0, ep.radius * 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,200,' + (alpha * 0.8) + ')';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(0, 0, ep.radius * 0.8, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                    ctx.restore();
                }
            }

            function drawParticles() {
                for (const p of particles) {
                    const alpha = p.life / p.maxLife;
                    ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;
                    ctx.fillStyle = p.color;
                    ctx.shadowColor = p.color;
                    ctx.shadowBlur = p.size * 1.5;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.size * alpha, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                }
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
            }

            function drawLimbDebris() {
                for (const d of limbDebris) {
                    const alpha = d.life / d.maxLife;
                    ctx.save();
                    ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;
                    ctx.translate(d.x, d.y);
                    ctx.rotate(d.rotation);
                    ctx.fillStyle = d.color;
                    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.4)';
                    ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;
                    if (d.type === 'head') {
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.roundRect(-d.size / 2, -d.size / 2, d.size, d.size * 0.8, 4);
                        ctx.fill();
                        ctx.stroke();
                        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,80,40,0.7)';
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.arc(d.size * 0.15, d.size * 0.1, d.size * 0.3, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                        ctx.fill();
                    } else {
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.roundRect(-d.size * 0.25, -d.size * 0.6, d.size * 0.5, d.size, 3);
                        ctx.fill();
                        ctx.stroke();
                        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,150,80,0.6)';
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.arc(0, -d.size * 0.5, d.size * 0.25, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                        ctx.fill();
                    }
                    ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                    ctx.restore();
                }
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
            }

            function drawHurtFlash() {
                if (hurtFlashTimer > 0) {
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,40,40,' + (hurtFlashTimer / 8) * 0.25 + ')';
                    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
                }
            }

            function drawAttackIndicators() {
                // 地面标记
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)';
                for (const e of enemies) {
                    if (!e || e.hp <= 0) continue;
                    if (e.state === 'windup' || e.state === 'shoot_windup') {
                        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,80,40,0.25)';
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.ellipse(e.x, e.y + 3, 34, 9, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                        ctx.fill();
                    }
                }
            }

            function render() {
                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, cw, ch);
                ctx.save();
                const scaleToCanvas = Math.min(cw / W, ch / H);
                const offsetX = (cw - W * scaleToCanvas) / 2;
                const offsetY = ch - H * scaleToCanvas;
                ctx.translate(offsetX + shakeX, offsetY + shakeY);
                ctx.scale(scaleToCanvas, scaleToCanvas);
                // 裁剪到游戏区域
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.rect(0, 0, W, H);
                ctx.clip();

                drawBackground();
                drawAttackIndicators();
                drawLimbDebris();
                for (const e of enemies) drawEnemy(e);
                drawPlayer();
                drawSlashes();
                drawProjectiles();
                drawParticles();
                drawHurtFlash();

                // 底部按键提示
                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.4)';
                ctx.font = '11px "Segoe UI",sans-serif';
                ctx.textAlign = 'center';
                ctx.fillText('A/D 移动  |  Space 跳跃  |  J 轻斩  |  K 重斩  |  L 冲刺  |  I 剑气  |  R 重开', W / 2, H -
                    12);

                ctx.restore();
            }

            // ==================== 游戏循环 ====================
            function gameLoop() {
                updateGame();
                render();
                requestAnimationFrame(gameLoop);
            }

            // ==================== 公共状态接口 ====================
            window.combatBenchState = function() {
                return {
                    ready: gameState !== 'start',
                    playerAlive: player.hp > 0 && gameState !== 'dead',
                    enemyCount: enemies.filter(e => e && e.hp > 0).length,
                    hitCount: hitCount,
                    limbBreakCount: limbBreakCount,
                    playing: gameState === 'playing',
                };
            };

            // ==================== 启动 ====================
            initCanvas();
            updateUI();
            gameLoop();
        })();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```
### 战斗体验与手感设计

这个试玩作品围绕“亲手操作很爽”的核心目标，从动作节奏、反馈强度和敌人行为三个层面构建了完整的战斗循环。

- **动作与节奏**：您可以使用**J键轻斩**打出三连段，轻斩的第三段和**K键重斩**均能将敌人击飞或打断肢体。**Space跳跃**支持二段跳，配合**L键冲刺**（附带无敌帧）和**I键剑气**（远程冲击），形成了“移动→突进→连段→终结”的完整操作链。角色的每个攻击都有明显的**前摇、出招和收招**动画，连段窗口内可无缝衔接，手感流畅。

- **命中反馈**：击中敌人时，画面会触发**命中顿帧**（hit stop），游戏会短暂停滞，且不同攻击的停顿时长不同。同时伴有**屏幕震动**、**刀光特效**、**受击火花**和**击退/击飞**效果。敌人被强力攻击命中时，其**头部或手臂会断裂飞散**，断肢后的敌人会改变行为（如失去手臂的敌人攻击能力大幅下降）。

- **敌人行为**：场景中会持续刷新两种敌人——**近战型敌人**会主动接近并挥砍，**远程型敌人**会保持距离射击。所有敌人攻击前都有**明显的视觉前兆**（如武器发光或感叹号标记），玩家可以观察并躲避。敌人的部位破坏是真正影响其战斗能力的设计，而不仅仅是视觉特效。

---

**优化建议：** 您可以在代码开头的`SLASH_TYPES`对象中调整各攻击的`damage`（伤害）、`hitStop`（顿帧时长）和`knockback`（击退力）来改变手感。敌人刷新速度可通过`ENEMY_RESPAWN_DELAY`变量修改。
